    $BODY$# Devastatiing Brain Injury

Discuss with donor coordinator Decision to test for brain death and brain death confirmed Consider or offer donation of organ after brain stem death (DBD)  Consider withdraw life support Discuss with donor coordinator Decision to withdraw life support treatment Consider DCD(donation after cardiac death) in those Pts who's DBI isn't improved even after 72 hrs of life support treatment  -9 Review management plan

