    v_module_id,
    'high-yield-clinical-sba-practice-56',
    'High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 56',
    'article',
    $BODY$# High-Yield Clinical SBA Practice 56

- **A)** RR>28 breath per minute O
- **B)** PH less 7.25
- **C)** Reduced conscious level O
- **D)** P0212.6 kPa
- **E)** PC02>6.5 kPa
- Explanation
- Indication of NIV in COPD PH < 7.35
- pC02> 6.5
