#### Clinical Scenario 2:
An 18-year-old gid came into ED with complaint of irritability and drovwiness. On initial assessment her blood glucose was 1.5 mmol/l that became 5.7 after initial management. Now she wants to go home and refuse admission. What is your appropriate action?
- **A)** Counsel the patient and discharge
