- X-ray shows widening of the distal tibio-fibular joint due to medial ankle ligament rupture (indicative of a rupture of the syndesmosis and interosseous membrane) and proximal fibula fracture. Mew Maisonneuve fracture results from an external rotation force applied to the foot.
