- Acute haemolytic transfusion reaction Allergic reaction Febrile non-haemolytic transfusion reaction Transfusion —related acute lung injury Delayed haemolytic reaction Post-transfusion purpura Volume overload Citrate toxicity Hypothermia Bacterial contamination Infectious disease transmission

