#### Clinical Scenario 2:
A 25-year-old young female brought into ED after being rescued from house fire. She has deep partial thickness burns covering her anterior trunk and both anterior upper limbs. Burn on upper extremity is complicated with severe pain. What is the appropriate management for her condition?
